  "contracts": {
    "admission": "One native API-owned 60/60 RateLimit binding below the five-second bounded calculator service; HTTP, RPC and Website private calls share a checked canonical connection key; batch members each consume one unit",
    "identity": "Cloudflare connection header only for direct edge requests; forwarded Worker calls rejected; no arbitrary forwarded header fallback. Website binding-only method passes checked identity separately from request JSON",
    "privacy": "Redacted IP Schema with ordinary encoding disabled; fixed rate/unavailable code, message and manual-retry fields; provider replies decoded and raw failures contained",
    "publicReplies": "HTTP 429 with Retry-After 60; unavailable admission HTTP 503. RPC revision 4 carries canonical calculator errors. No automatic retry",
    "configuration": "Required checked positive decimal CALCULATOR_RATE_NAMESPACE with no cloud default. Native graph defaults to edge; guarded disposable local root selects local-emulator and isolated namespace 10075, requiring HTTP loopback origin",
    "metadata": "No allowance unit; actual missing/invalid/throwing native binding tests retain metadata success",
    "scope": "Direct engine, local SDK and standalone Bun retain their existing policy; no tax algorithm or saved-oracle change",
    "nativeRpc": "Installed native RPC adapter; explicit AbortSignal is omitted because the pinned runtime rejects serialisation. Local cancellation and server work/reply budgets remain; no remote cancellation claim"
  },
